es not directly address whether the tiger sees the dog in general.\n4.The context does not provide any information about the tiger seeing the dog directly.The tiger sees the dog, contradicted by the given information, does not necessarily mean the tiger is green and big.. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
