ans Gary is not young.\n- But we know from point 5 that Dave is not young.\n- Since Dave is blue, according to point 16, Dave is mean.\n- Since Dave is mean, according to point 12, Dave is purple.\n- Since Dave is purple, according to point 17, Dave is loud.\n- Since Dave is loud, according to point 18, Dave is mean.\nThis creates a contradiction because we have established that Bob is not young, but we also have information that Dave is not young.The only way to resolve this contradiction is to conclude that the information provided is consistent.\nGiven this consistency, we can definitively determine Bob\'s age\n. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
