reen.\nGiven all this information, we can conclude:\n- Fiona is nice (from point 2).\n- Fiona is not rough (from point 4).\n- Fiona is not quiet (from point 1 and point 14).\n- Fiona is blue (from point 11).\n- Fiona is green (from point 10, since round things are not green and Fiona is round). Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
