ll round things are not blue.\n5.Round, cold things are not big.\n6.If something is green then it is not blue.\nFrom point 6, we know if something is green, it is not blue.However, we don\'t have information about Anne\'s color directly.\nSince we have no direct information about Anne\'s color and the only information we have about her is that she is big and rough, we cannot definitively conclude whether she is blue or not.We only know that rough things are not red, and round things are not blue, but we don\'t know if Anne is round\n. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
