a description of the squirrel\'s color.).\n8.All red people are young.(This is a general statement about red people being young.).\n9.If the squirrel is green and the squirrel likes the rabbit then the rabbit eats the mouse.(This is a conditional statement about the rabbit eating the mouse if the squirrel is green and likes the rabbit.).\n10.If someone sees the cat and they like the squirrel then the squirrel sees the cat.(This is a conditional statement about the squirrel seeing the cat if someone sees the cat and likes the squirrel.).\n11.If someone is young then they see the mouse.(This is a conditional statement about someone seeing the mouse if they are young.).\nThe cat eats the squirrel.. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
