is furry.\n- We know Bob is not green (point 1), but we don\'t know if he is furry.\nGiven this information, we cannot definitively conclude whether Dave is not green or not. We know he is not furry, which means he is not big, but we don\'t have enough information about his niceness, kindness, or age to determine if he is young and therefore green.. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
