e tiger, the tiger needs the squirrel.\n10.If the mouse needs the bald eagle and the bald eagle likes the mouse, the bald eagle is rough.\n11.If the mouse needs the squirrel, the squirrel likes the mouse.\n12.The squirrel does need the squirrel.. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
