hey are quiet (from point 13).\nHowever, all of these points directly provide information about Bob\'s age. The plentiful information we have about Bob\'s age is that Fiona is old (point 4), and this necessarily means that Bob is old as well.\nAdditionally, we have information that indirectly links Bob\'s age to all of the other individuals mentioned.\nGiven this analysis, we can definitively determine that Bob is old based on the provided information. We not only know that Fiona is old, but this definitely implies that Bob is old as well.. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
