 then it likes the bald eagle.\n16.If something sees the bald eagle then it is rough.\n17.If the cat is kind and the cat likes the mouse then the cat does not see the lion.\nThe bald eagle likes the lion, so it does not eat the lion.. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
