ot cold.Since Anne is not round, she is not cold.\n- From point 11, if something is not cold, it is not green.Since Anne is not cold, she would not be green even if she were cold.\n- However, from point 14, if something is not cold and blue, it is not rough.Since Anne is not cold and blue, this condition applies to her.\nGiven this analysis, we can conclude that Anne is not blue and not smart, which means she is not rough and not round.Since she is not cold and blue, she would not be green even if she were cold.But since she is blue and cold, she can be green\n. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
